Package: mi9t-hardware-support
Version: 1.0.2
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Mi 9T local maintenance
Depends: libc6, libglib2.0-0t64, libqmi-glib5 (>= 1.33.4), libprotobuf-c1, libgudev-1.0-0, libpolkit-gobject-1-0, iio-sensor-proxy, systemd
Description: Mi 9T audio DSP and automatic rotation support
 Device specific integration of hexagonrpc 0.5.0, libssc 0.4.4,
 iio-sensor-proxy 3.9 and the sm7150-mainline speaker UCM profile.
